    {
      "x": 13830,
      "text": "Some things survive because we carry them together."
    },
    {
      "x": 7570,
      "text": "Ash lifts before the wind reaches you. Bring him behind the wall and wait."
    },
    {
      "x": 10060,
      "text": "The last few steps can still hurt. Secure the awning, or wait beneath the wall."
    },
    {
